<title>USA: Milwaukee Land holders approve acquisition.</title>
<headline>Milwaukee Land holders approve acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milwaukee Land Co said on Thursday its shareholders approved the acquisition of PG Design Electronics Inc for $15 million and the assumption of an estimated $1.5 million in bank debt.</p>
<p>Closing the transaction is now subject to financing and other matters typical in this type of transaction, the company said.</p>
<p>PG Design provides printed circuit board assemblies and products for the computer industry. It had 1996 sales of about $25 million and expects sales of about $30 million in 1997.</p>
<p>Milwaukee Land is a management investment company.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
